## Marisa Kernel For Xiaomi Crux (Xiaomi 9 Pro)

## Compile guide
### Toolkit
You need a proton-clang build to build the kernel, try download one and put it somewhere.

### How to compile
Open the build.sh using your editor, change some values follow by the comments, and simpily run the build.sh 

